<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.40 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.40 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bills auction on Tuesday compared to the August 20 auction  SUVK :</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				169-day T-bills   176-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.50 pct	    3.69 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.50 pct	    3.69 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.49 pct	    3.69 pct</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million	  260		   343</p>
<p> Bids, million mk	     621		   348</p>
<p> Maturing date	    Feb 14, 1997	Feb 14, 1997</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				259-day T-bills   266-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.66 pct	    3.81 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.66 pct	    3.81 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.65 pct	    3.81 pct</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million	  500		   100</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million	    500		   100</p>
<p> Maturing date	    May 15, 1997	May 15, 1997</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				351-day T-bills   358-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.84 pct	    3.98 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.84 pct	    3.98 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.83 pct	    3.98 pct</p>
<p> Amount, million mk	   643		   150</p>
<p> Bids, million mk	     1,568		 351</p>
<p> Maturing date	    August 15, 1997   August 15, 1997</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.5 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 47,045 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
